{"seq":2,"slug":"content-and-platforms","title":"内容与平台","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-brand-building-in-public/content-and-platforms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"choosing-platforms-channels","title":"选择平台与渠道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-brand-building-in-public/content-and-platforms/choosing-platforms-channels","wordCount":3533,"readingTime":15},{"seq":2,"slug":"sustainable-content-engine","title":"可持续的内容引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-brand-building-in-public/content-and-platforms/sustainable-content-engine","wordCount":3565,"readingTime":15},{"seq":3,"slug":"writing-and-expression","title":"写作与表达","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-brand-building-in-public/content-and-platforms/writing-and-expression","wordCount":3382,"readingTime":14}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"内容与平台-简介\">内容与平台 简介</h1><p>理解了逻辑,接下来是落地:<strong>在哪里发、发什么、怎么把它写好</strong>。本章讲清内容与平台:先是<strong>选择平台与渠道</strong>（Twitter/X、博客、LinkedIn、YouTube、newsletter 各自的特点、取舍与组合,以及怎么按你的内容和受众选），然后是<strong>可持续的内容引擎</strong>（不靠灵感爆发,而是把日常工作的副产品系统化地变成内容、批量与流程化,让产出可持续），最后是<strong>写作与表达</strong>（清晰胜过华丽、用钩子抓住注意力、用好结构、把复杂的东西讲简单）。这一章的核心是:公开构建的产出引擎要<strong>可持续</strong>——靠系统而非灵感、靠真实工作的副产品而非硬挤、靠清晰表达而非辞藻,才能在长期里稳定地产出有价值的内容。</p>\n"}